<lb n="29"/>halb geschwornen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eïd</unclear>, vor etlichen jaren, (moechte
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungfard</unclear> umb. 8. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jar</unclear> sein.) habe er <persName resp="#ner">Daniel
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schindern</unclear></persName> im <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mogkeneegkh</unclear></placeName> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kalb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aberkaufft</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebnmaeßig</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> orten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> vier
<lb n="33"/>kaelber gleicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aufkaufft</unclear>, wie er
<lb n="34"/>nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">+</unclear> an einem <date resp="#ner">donstag</date> inß land gangen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">+</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jung</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>in meinung die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kaelber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeholen</unclear>, habe er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knaben</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/>sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abendts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verspaetet</unclear>, und dieweil es nun
<lb n="37"/>ein gar kalte nacht gewesen, habe er alß
<lb n="38"/>er zuo gemelts <persName resp="#ner">Danielen</persName> hauß komen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frosts</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnemlich</unclear> wegen deß jungen
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">knaben</unclear>, alß der die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kaelte</unclear> nit wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erleiden</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> Danielen umb die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachtherberg</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angesprochen</unclear>, die er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verweigeret</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürwendende</unclear>, er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künde</unclear> die nacht niemand
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herbergen</unclear>. Zeüg aber noch mehr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anghalten</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> fürgeworffen, wie er zeüg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear>
