<lb n="47"/>handlet.) auch vil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> gethan, solle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölichen</unclear> dienst nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verweigeren</unclear>. Der
<lb n="49"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schinder</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verantwortet</unclear>, er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">künde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herbergen</unclear>, dann umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miternacht</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gäst</unclear> komen. Also zeüg
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> noch ernstlicher gebetten, solle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>und den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">knaben</unclear> nur ein schlaff thuon
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, und dann wann es zeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿ</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> der nacht, wann er wolle, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weckhen</unclear>,
<lb n="56"/>so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> er dann wider auß dem
<lb n="57"/>hauß. Auf welches er Schinder
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1617_5874.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="58"/>inen die herberg bewilliget, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> schlaff
